{"id":"W921f8bea6fdfee0b0578b16d","zh":"轨距扩大","en":"","name":"轨距扩大","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W921f8bea6fdfee0b0578b16d","text":"轨距扩大","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S4814c41fcba6458b4ded","source_id":"P128","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"随着曲线半径减小,钢轨动态轨距扩大量逐渐增大,以调高60 mm 工况为例,当曲线半径由5 000 m 降低到2 800 m 时,轨距扩大量由 0.40 mm 增加到0.67 mm,增幅达67.50%,但仍满足相关规范的限值要求。","citations":[{"source_id":"P128","page":7,"page_end":7}]},{"id":"Sfa7225c5a25584d69838","source_id":"P128","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"在相同运行条件下, 客车的轨距扩大量在0.67 mm,货车为1.41 mm, 增幅为110.45%,虽增幅较大,但仍满足规范规定的限值要求。","citations":[{"source_id":"P128","page":8,"page_end":8}]}],"sources":{"P128":{"id":"P128","title":"平曲线上大调整量弹性支承块式轨道结构动力响应规律分析","authors":"闫斌,金浩然,杜香刚,徐磊,盘柳","year":"2024","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2024.07.033","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"闫斌等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-analysis-of-dynamic-response-law-of-elastic-support-block-rail-structure-with-large-adjustment-on-fl"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"两股钢轨间距的动态增大量，用于评价轨距保持能力。","language":"zh","source_id":"P128","paper_slug":"2024-analysis-of-dynamic-response-law-of-elastic-support-block-rail-structure-with-large-adjustment-on-fl","title":"平曲线上大调整量弹性支承块式轨道结构动力响应规律分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wab41892aaa307be6439f7006","name":"gauge expansion","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wab41892aaa307be6439f7006","name":"gauge expansion","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wab41892